<title>USA: Cornell Corrections boosts number of IPO shares.</title>
<headline>Cornell Corrections boosts number of IPO shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cornell Corrections has increased the number of shares to be offered in its proposed initial public offering to four million, a spokesman for underwriter Dillon Read &amp; Co said on Friday.</p>
<p>Cornell previously planned to offer 3.5 million shares. The estimated price range of $11 to $13 remains the same.</p>
<p>The IPO is expected in early October, he said.</p>
</text>
